@host = http://localhost:5075

# Generate tokens with (stored in user-secrets, never committed):
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project CasePriority.Api --role CaseManager --valid-for 1h
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project CasePriority.Api --role Viewer     --valid-for 1h
@token = PASTE_CASE_MANAGER_TOKEN_HERE
@viewerToken = PASTE_VIEWER_TOKEN_HERE

### No token — should return 401 Unauthorized + WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET {{host}}/api/cases
Accept: application/json

### Viewer attempting to create — should return 403 Forbidden
POST {{host}}/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "WEB-0001",
  "subject": "Authorization test",
  "severity": 3
}

### Create (CaseManager)
POST {{host}}/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "WEB-0001",
  "subject": "User cannot access the portal",
  "severity": 3
}

### Retrieve current state and ETag
GET {{host}}/api/cases/WEB-0001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Close version 1
PATCH {{host}}/api/cases/WEB-0001/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "1"

### Stale update — should return 412 Precondition Failed
PATCH {{host}}/api/cases/WEB-0001/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "1"

### Reopen current version 2
PATCH {{host}}/api/cases/WEB-0001/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "2"

### Change severity at version 3
PATCH {{host}}/api/cases/WEB-0001/severity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: "3"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "severity": 5
}

### Missing If-Match — should return 428 Precondition Required
PATCH {{host}}/api/cases/WEB-0001/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
